{"step_index":93,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T17:09:11Z","thinking":"**Testing Backend Endpoints**\n\nI've got the Python backend and SQLite database up and running, no issues there. Currently, I'm focused on rigorously testing all the backend endpoints. I'm using Python's Test Client and HTTPX to ensure everything is behaving as expected, specifically focusing on the `/api/status`, `/api/trips`, and `/api/ai` endpoints. I'm hitting those POST endpoints to ensure they work too!\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport asyncio\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\nfrom backend.app import app\n\nclient = TestClient(app)\n\n# 1. Status\nres = client.get('/api/status')\nprint('Status test:', res.status_code, res.json())\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 2. Trips GET\nres = client.get('/api/trips')\nprint('Trips GET count:', len(res.json()))\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 3. AI Route POST\nres = client.post('/api/ai/route', json={'prompt': 'Thiruvananthapuram -> Alappuzha -> Kochi -> Munnar'})\nprint('AI Route test:', res.status_code, res.json())\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 4. AI Parse Trip POST\nres = client.post('/api/ai/parse-trip', json={'text': 'Took a KSRTC bus from Trivandrum to Kollam at 8:30 AM for office work, paid 65 rupees'})\nprint('AI Parse Trip test:', res.status_code, res.json())\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 5. Tourism Destinations GET\nres = client.get('/api/tourism/destinations')\nprint('Tourism destinations count:', len(res.json()))\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 6. Analytics Mode Split GET\nres = client.get('/api/analytics/mode-split')\nprint('Analytics mode split:', res.status_code, res.json())\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\n# 7. SQL Query POST (backward compatibility)\nres = client.post('/api/query', json={'sql': 'SELECT id, title, travel_mode, fare_cost FROM trips LIMIT 2;'})\nprint('SQL Query test:', res.status_code, res.json())\nassert res.status_code == 200\n\nprint('ALL BACKEND API TESTS PASSED PERFECTLY!')\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Running comprehensive backend API test suite","toolSummary":"Run API test suite"}}]}
